#question(title: [Related implications])[
  Let $a in RR$. Let $f$ be a function.
  Assume we know
  $
    0 < abs(x - a) < 0.1 quad ==> quad f(x) > 100
  $

  + Which values of $M in RR$ satisfy ... ?
     $
       0 < abs(x - a) < 0.1 quad ==> quad f(x) > M
     $
  + Which values of $delta > 0$ satisfy ... ?
     $
       0 < abs(x - a) < delta quad ==> quad f(x) > 100
     $
]
